{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301705","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301705","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1230170501:1":{"text":"그렇다네. 안개가 걷힌 뒤 모든 것이 정상으로 돌아왔지.","source_cn":"是的，迷雾消散后，一切又恢复正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE042E967D9EEFAF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230170502:1":{"text":"화물을 의뢰한 상인들이 불안해하며 빨리 출항하라고 계속 재촉하고 있어.","source_cn":"委托运输货物的商人很着急，不停地催促我们早日启程。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86E8B937D43D004B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230170503:1":{"text":"이제 막 항로가 열렸으니 러스트 항의 해산물에 대해 궁금해하는 사람이 많아서, 가치가 엄청나요!","source_cn":"因为航路刚开，锈锚港的海货现在奇货可居，价值不菲！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15076AB45696E817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230170504:1":{"text":"맞아. 그러니 얼른 출항 준비를 하도록 해. 시간은 기다려주지 않아.","source_cn":"说的没错，准备启程吧，时间不等人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E8D0A4EFC115962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:船长布莱杰":{"text":"선장 브리짓","source":"船长布莱杰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水手欧米拉":{"text":"선원 오마라","source":"水手欧米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}